# A chat on a computer: words in its composer, a line and another started and one taken back: the box's ground goes
# from the shape it had to the new one, its ＋, words and send from where they showed (docs/motion.md: moved or
# reshaped, for its cause).
# MBUI_FIXTURE=webdemo MBUI_WIN=1280x800.
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 把那个弄一下
wait 900
tap 发消息
wait 700
type 帮我看一下登录按钮
wait 300
key shift+enter
wait 600
type 还有注册页
wait 300
key shift+enter
wait 600
key backspace
wait 700
exit
